\f1\b\fs19\fsmilli9600 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 Sub-module 3.2: Messaging Alignment Audit\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f0\b0\fs2 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \uc0\u8232 
\fs38 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b\fs57 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 Messaging Alignment Audit\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\fs38 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 {{\NeXTGraphic Attachment.png \width320 \height320 \appleattachmentpadding0 \appleembedtype0 \appleaqc
}¬}
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Students will take on the role of a communication strategist tasked with evaluating whether an organization \'93walks its talk.\'94 This means reviewing real-world messaging\'97on websites, social media, press releases, and leadership communications\'97and assessing whether those messages reflect the organization's stated mission, values, and strategic goals. This activity helps students think critically about consistency, credibility, and brand integrity in strategic communication.\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cf7 \strokec7 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Learning Activities\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 1) Read The Business Writer's Handbook information:
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \'a0This resource from\'a0\AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 The Business Writer\'92s Handbook\AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \'a0offers essential guidance for conducting a Messaging Alignment Audit. It helps students evaluate how well an organization\'92s public messages align with its mission, tone, brand identity, and strategic communication plans\'97key skills for clear, consistent, and credible business writing.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 2) Watch Simon Sinek Masterclass: The Key Steps To Finding Your Purpose:\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 In this insightful masterclass, Simon Sinek guides viewers through the key steps to uncovering their purpose and reconnecting with their "Why." Drawing from years of leadership research and real-world experience, Sinek explains how purpose isn\'92t something we invent\'97it\'92s something we discover by reflecting on our values, our stories, and the impact we want to have. Whether you're at a crossroads in your career or seeking deeper meaning in your life, this session offers a thoughtful, inspiring roadmap to help you lead with intention and live with clarity.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 3) Review Patagonia's Core Values website:\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 Patagonia\'92s core values reflect a bold commitment to environmental and social responsibility. They build the best product, cause no unnecessary harm, use business to protect nature, and challenge convention\'97all in service of their mission: to save our home planet.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 4) Optional written assignment: (you do not turn this in; however, it helps prepare you for the Milestone and Final Assessment)
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 Instructions:
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Choose a real-world example of a company or organization that received public criticism for a message or campaign that\'a0
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 conflicted with its values or failed to resonate with its audience
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 .\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 In your analysis (500\'96600 words), address the following:\cb1 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa380\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl1
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf2 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Describe the situation:
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \'a0What was the campaign/message and how was it received?\cb1 \
\ls3\ilvl1
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Identify the disconnect:
