\f1\b\fs19\fsmilli9600 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 Sub-module 3.3: When Messages Miss the Mark\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f0\b0\fs2 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \uc0\u8232 
\fs38 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b\fs57 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 When Messages Miss the Mark\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\fs38 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 {{\NeXTGraphic Attachment.png \width320 \height320 \appleattachmentpadding0 \appleembedtype0 \appleaqc
}¬}
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \uc0\u8232 \cb3 Even the most trusted organizations can damage their reputation with a single poorly crafted message. In this submodule, students will explore what happens when messages don\'92t align with brand values, audience expectations, or current cultural context. By studying these missteps, you\'92ll strengthen your ability to identify risks before they escalate and develop communication strategies that stay true to your organization\'92s voice, mission, and goals.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 \cf7 \strokec7 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Learning Activities
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 1) Watch Here's why Kendall Jenner's Pepsi ad is so controversial:\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 This video unpacks the 2017 Pepsi commercial featuring Kendall Jenner\'97widely criticized for trivializing protest movements, including Black Lives Matter. It examines how the ad attempted to depict unity with a can of soda but instead sparked backlash for co-opting serious social justice imagery. Through thoughtful critique and insight, the analysis explores why the campaign missed the mark and how consumer reactions forced Pepsi to pull the ad within hours.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 2) Watch Gillette's We believe: the best men can be razors commercial takes on toxic masculinity:\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 This thought-provoking ad from Gillette addresses evolving cultural expectations around masculinity. Coming in the wake of the #MeToo movement, it challenges men to hold one another accountable\'97calling out bullying, harassment, and toxic behaviors while celebrating everyday acts of kindness and integrity. It\'92s a bold and reflective take on what being \'93the best a man can be\'94 means in today\'92s world\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 3) Read Essential Entries for Strategic Messaging, Crisis Response, and Public Trust:\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 The Business Writer\'92s Handbook\AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \'a0offers clear, practical guidance for writing with credibility and composure during high-stakes moments. Use these essential entries to shape strategic messages that build trust and lead with clarity.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 4) Read Enhancing Corporate Social Responsibility (XSR) Communication and Stakeholder Engagement: Strategies for Building Trust and Fostering Social Impact:\'a0
\f0\b0 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 This article highlights the importance of authentic CSR communication in building trust and avoiding reputational risks. Using Legitimacy Theory and real-world examples, it offers strategies for engaging stakeholders, aligning messages with values, and fostering meaningful social impact.\'a0\cb1 \uc0\u8232 
\f1\b \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 5)\'a0Optional Assignment: Message Makeover Lab (you do not turn this in; however, it helps prepare you for the Milestone and Final Assessment)
